    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that two or more contracting authorities may agree to perform certain procurements jointly.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If the entire procurement procedure is carried out jointly, all contracting authorities are jointly responsible for fulfilling their obligations under Part 2 of the PCR 2015. If one contracting authority manages the procedure on behalf of the others, all contracting authorities remain jointly responsible.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If only parts of the procedure are conducted jointly, contracting authorities are only jointly responsible for those parts; and each contracting authority is individually responsible for the parts they conduct.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where a procurement is performed jointly the contracting authorities remain responsible to fulfil all their obligations under the entirety of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "when launching a joint procurement, consider all of their obligations under the entirety of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (for which they remain responsible)",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Occasional joint procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
